## Visualize Missing Data: geom_miss_point with ggplot

```{r, warning = T, eval = F}
nhanes |>
  ggplot(aes(x = Pulse, y = TotChol)) +
  geom_miss_point() +
  facet_wrap(~HealthGen) +
  labs(title = "Total Cholestrol over Pulse by General Health", 
       y = "Total Chelesterol (mmol/L)", 
       x = "Pulse (bbm)", 
       color = "Missing")+
  geom_smooth(method = "lm", se = F) +
  theme_light()
```

